    <!-- Mission -->
    <div class="mission-section">
      <div class="mission-inner">
        <div>
          <div class="s-label" data-i18n="mission.label">Our Mission</div>
          <div class="mission-quote" data-i18n="mission.quote">"Making professional geospatial skills accessible to
            every Cambodian learner â€” at
            an affordable price."</div>
          <p class="mission-text" data-i18n="mission.text1">GIS education in Cambodia has traditionally been limited to
            expensive software,
            desktop workflows, and a handful of institutions. The Island GIS was created to change that â€” to give
            Cambodian students and professionals access to the same tools and methods used by researchers and geospatial
            engineers globally.</p>
          <p class="mission-text" data-i18n="mission.text2">We believe the gap between a Cambodian GIS student and a
            global geospatial
            professional is not talent. It is access, language, and the right kind of teaching.</p>
          <button class="btn btn-outline-green" data-i18n="mission.btn" onclick="showPage('about')"
            style="margin-top:8px">Read our full story
            â†’</button>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="s-label" data-i18n="commit.label">Three Commitments</div>
          <div class="s-title" data-i18n="commit.title" style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:24px">What we promise every
            student</div>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
            <div
              style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 22px;border-left:4px solid var(--g4)">
              <div data-i18n="commit.1.title" style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:var(--g1);margin-bottom:5px">
                Affordable Â· Always</div>
              <div data-i18n="commit.1.text" style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-m);line-height:1.6">Priced for
                Cambodian salaries, not
                international ones. Early bird discounts and small cohorts keep quality high without making it
                exclusive.</div>
            </div>
            <div
              style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 22px;border-left:4px solid var(--g4)">
              <div data-i18n="commit.2.title" style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:var(--g1);margin-bottom:5px">
                Taught in Khmer</div>
              <div data-i18n="commit.2.text" style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-m);line-height:1.6">Every live
                session is in Khmer with
                English technical terms. Complex ideas are easier to grasp in your first language â€” and that matters
                when the concepts are hard.</div>
            </div>
            <div
              style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 22px;border-left:4px solid var(--g4)">
              <div data-i18n="commit.3.title" style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:var(--g1);margin-bottom:5px">
                Practical & Verifiable</div>
              <div data-i18n="commit.3.text" style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-m);line-height:1.6">No paper
                certificates. You leave with a
                GitHub portfolio, a live web app, and a project employers and research supervisors can open and read
                themselves.</div>
            </div>
            <div
              style="background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 22px;border-left:4px solid var(--g4)">
              <div data-i18n="commit.4.title" style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:var(--g1);margin-bottom:5px">
                ðŸ’¬ Community After Class
              </div>
              <div data-i18n="commit.4.text" style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-m);line-height:1.6">The course
                ends, but the support doesn't.
                Every cohort stays connected through a dedicated Telegram group â€” ask questions, share projects, and
                get
                guidance from your instructor and fellow learners long after the final session.</div>
            </div>
