        <div class="panel-section" style="margin-top:24px">
          <div class="panel-section-title" data-i18n="ci.bg.title">Background</div>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-m);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px" data-i18n="ci.bg.p1">
            Geospatial specialist with
            cross-sector experience across humanitarian demining (Apopo, HALO Trust Cambodia), government infrastructure
            (Ministry of Post and Telecommunications, Ministry of Land Management), and academic remote sensing research
            (IRD). Published researcher at KHEOBS Day 2024 and FOSS4G-Asia 2024.</p>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-m);line-height:1.7" data-i18n="ci.bg.p2">Holds a BSc in Land
            Management and Land
            Administration (GIS & Remote Sensing) from the Royal University of Agriculture. His published UHI
            research on Phnom Penh forms the backbone of the Urban Heat Island module in this course â€” students work
            from real, published methodology.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-section">
          <div class="panel-section-title" data-i18n="ci.pub.title">Published Research</div>
          <div
            style="background:var(--g-pale);border-left:4px solid var(--g4);border-radius:8px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:12px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--g1);margin-bottom:4px" data-i18n="ci.pub.1.title">
              Effects of Land Use/Land
              Cover Changes on Surface Urban Heat Island Intensity in Phnom Penh</div>
            <div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-l)" data-i18n="ci.pub.1.desc">KHEOBS Day 2024 Â· LST retrieval
              Â·
              NDVI correlation Â·
              Emissivity correction</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:var(--g-pale);border-left:4px solid var(--g4);border-radius:8px;padding:16px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--g1);margin-bottom:4px" data-i18n="ci.pub.2.title">
              Urban Green Space Mapping
              and Analysis â€” Phnom Penh</div>
            <div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-l)" data-i18n="ci.pub.2.desc">FOSS4G-Asia 2024 Â· NDVI-based
              extraction Â· Urban ecology
            </div>
          </div>
